From 1aefe46950d3ad31bd2d7641e5861c265a895fe2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayden Holley <jaydenlholley@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:09:24 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] common: UWP file access through *FromApp APIs and a
 frontend path translator

Xbox Dev Mode apps run in an app container, so the desktop Win32 file APIs
cannot reach removable storage. Route Azahar's Win32 file calls through the
*FromApp variants when building for UWP, and add FileUtil::SetPathTranslator
so a frontend can point texture packs, mods and cheats at user-chosen folders.
Console logging and LoadLibraryA are replaced with UWP-safe equivalents.
